I don't know about you, but if someone showed me a list like this about a piece
of technology, I might be concerned about the level of oversight it might be
getting and whether we might want to investigate it a bit further.

At the same time, you might also wonder if we're just stuck with LLMs or
whether there might be something else we could try. Turns out, [there are quite
a few
things](/blog/2025-11-08-the-vivarium-ai-experimentation-platform/).
